{"articleNo":"149216","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=149216&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2016 수원 드론 페스티벌 등 행사 개최 일정 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.03.28","hit":"2314","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">미래 성장동력산업으로 급부상하고 있는 드론,로봇에 대한 관심 제고, 산업 활성화 및 함께 공감하고 체험할 수 있는 2016 수원 드론 행사 개최 일정을 아래와 같이 알려드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">[행사 개요]</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; □ 2016 수원 드론 페스티벌</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 개최기간 : 2016. 6. 25(토) ~ 6. 26(일)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소 : 아주대학교 운동장 일원</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 주요 행사내용</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 대&nbsp; 회 : 드론미션대회, 미니드론레이싱대회 </span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 드론 비즈니스관, 드론 전시관, 드론 체험관</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 드론 시연, 드론 체험, 교육</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 공모전 우수작 시연 및 전시(드론 아이디어 경진대회, 드론 컨텐츠대회)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 공식행사(개막식, 개막축하공연, 시상/폐막식) 및 부대행사 등.</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; □ 2016 수원 드론 아이디어 경진대회</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 개최기간 : 2016. 5. 16(월) ~ 6. 20(월)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소 : 수원시청 및 아주대학교(예정)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 주요 행사내용 : 드론,로봇 아이디어 경진대회(공모전)&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 공모기간 : 2016. 5. 16(월) ~ 5. 26(목)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; □ 2016 드론 컨텐츠대회(수원 드론 영화제)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 개최기간 : 2016. 4. 4(월) ~ 6. 17(금)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소 : 수원 화성박물관 일원</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 주요 행사내용 : 드론영화 공모전, 출품작 상영(수원화성박물관), 드론 공연, 체험</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 공모기간 : 2016. 4. 4(월) ~ 5. 12(금)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 개막식 및 부대행사 등.&nbsp; 끝.</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
